    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "My instincts tell me to pull this girl to safety and hide her away from two different storms.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "The first of the two batters us with heavy raindrops and soaks us to the core.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "I’m colder now than I’ve ever felt before.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "The second storm is the one you probably assumed I was alluding to.",
      "zh": ""
