      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "I grab Miku’s hand and pull her under the first archway I can find to shelter her from the rain.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "I’m not sure what is going on, but letting her just stand here in the middle of a downpour isn’t going to help in any way.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": NO! DON'T TOUCH-",
